---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
const storiesUrl = `${base}/stories/`;
---

<BaseLayout title="About — 山 / SHAN">
  <section class="about">
    <div class="eyebrow">Behind the journal</div>
    <h1>Hello, I’m Shan.</h1>
    <p>
      I’m interested in forests, useful technology, and the ways a place
      changes when we take the time to notice it.
    </p>
    <p>
      這裡收集一些沿途的觀察：走進森林的筆記、生活裡的照片，還有尚在整理的想法。
    </p>
    <p>
      森を歩くこと、写真を撮ること、少しずつ学ぶこと。この場所は、その小さな記録です。
    </p>
    <p>
      Stories are for thoughts that need a little room. Moments are for what a
      photograph can hold.
    </p>
    <a class="back" href={storiesUrl}>Explore the journal →</a>
    <p class="hint">
      This personal publishing website is designed for long-term independent
      maintenance.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
